                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A starship enters the same zone as the trap</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> In another reality, familiar crew members have different roles. All creatures helming a battle station on board the starship must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:28] save. Each creature that fails is teleported at random to another battle station or a space adjacent to a different battle station if all of them are helmed. Once within the next hour, an affected creature can spend 1 action that has the concentrate trait to access knowledge from other timelines, allowing it to choose one of the following skills: @Check[arcana|dc:28], @Check[computers|dc:28], @Check[crafting|dc:28], @Check[occultism|dc:28], @Check[nature|dc:28], @Check[piloting|dc:28], or @Check[religion|dc:28]. For 1 minute, the creature can use that skill in place of any different required skill when taking a station action at the station they were teleported to.</p>"
